---
// Keyboard skip link — the first focusable element on every page. Visually
// hidden (clipped, not merely translated off-screen) until a keyboard user
// focuses it, so it can never paint over page content when unfocused. Appears
// above the sticky header on :focus / :focus-visible.
---

<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>

<style>
  .skip {
    position: fixed;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    /* above the sticky header (--z-header) and the mobile nav (--z-nav) */
    z-index: calc(var(--z-nav) + 10);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-ink);
    border-radius: var(--r-2);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
    /* hidden until focused — clipped to nothing so it never shows or takes space */
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    clip-path: inset(50%);
  }
  .skip:focus,
  .skip:focus-visible {
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    margin: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
    overflow: visible;
    clip: auto;
    clip-path: none;
  }
</style>
